<!--
    The neutral (English) resource dictionary of the Ref Lab presentation layer.

    Scope: the English surface of the application — screen titles, column
    headers, administration labels and the English test-catalogue wording.
    The Arabic surface has its own dictionary, Resources/Strings.ar.xaml, and
    the two dictionaries use disjoint key sets, so a surface always renders in
    the language it was designed for regardless of the workstation locale.

    Every Arabic string in this project is authorised by Docs/ui-labels-verified.md.
    This dictionary contains no Arabic.
-->
